          "text": "theoremos.algebra.finitesums.sum_squares\nsum_squares (n : ℕ) : (∑ k ∈ range n, (k : ℝ) ^ 2) = (n : ℝ) * ((n : ℝ) - 1) * (2 * (n : ℝ) - 1) / 6\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.algebra.finitesums.\nthe real sum of squares, including the empty sum.\nthe real sum of squares, including the empty sum.\n在给定条件下，所示有限和满足此恒等式。\nunder the stated conditions, the displayed finite sums satisfy this identity.\n(∑ k ∈ range n, (k : ℝ) ^ 2) = (n : ℝ) * ((n : ℝ) - 1) * (2 * (n : ℝ) - 1) / 6\n\nthe real sum of squares, including the empty sum.\n参数 n\ninput n\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ"
