        "TheoremOS.Algebra.FiniteSums.affine_recurrence": {
          "summary": {
            "zh": "将一阶仿射递推展开为初值项与有限等比和。",
            "en": "Expands a first-order affine recurrence into its initial-value term and a finite geometric sum."
          },
          "text": "theoremos.algebra.finitesums.affine_recurrence\naffine_recurrence {r : type*} [commring r] (f : ℕ → r) (a b : r) (n : ℕ) (h : ∀ k < n, f (k + 1) = a * f k + b) : f n = a ^ n * f 0 + b * (∑ k ∈ range n, a ^ k)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.algebra.finitesums.\n将一阶仿射递推展开为初值项与有限等比和。\nexpands a first-order affine recurrence into its initial-value term and a finite geometric sum.\n在给定条件下，所示有限和满足此恒等式。\nunder the stated conditions, the displayed finite sums satisfy this identity.\nf n = a ^ n * f 0 + b * (∑ k ∈ range n, a ^ k)\n\nsolve an affine first-order recurrence without dividing by the multiplier minus one.\n参数 r\ninput r\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n交换环结构\ncommutative ring structure\ncommring r\n参数 f\ninput f\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nℕ → r\n参数 a b\ninput a b\n具有所示类型的数学对象\nmathematical object of the displayed type\nr\n参数 n\ninput n\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ\n假设 h\nassumption h\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ k < n, f (k + 1) = a * f k + b"
        },
        "TheoremOS.Algebra.FiniteSums.affine_recurrence_closed": {
          "summary": {
            "zh": "递推系数 a 不等于 1 时，给出 f(k+1) = a f(k) + b 的闭式。",
            "en": "When a differs from 1, gives a closed formula for f(k+1) = a f(k) + b."
          },
          "text": "theoremos.algebra.finitesums.affine_recurrence_closed\naffine_recurrence_closed {k : type*} [field k] (f : ℕ → k) (a b : k) (n : ℕ) (ha : a ≠ 1) (h : ∀ k < n, f (k + 1) = a * f k + b) : f n = a ^ n * f 0 + b * (a ^ n - 1) / (a - 1)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.algebra.finitesums.\n递推系数 a 不等于 1 时，给出 f(k+1) = a f(k) + b 的闭式。\nwhen a differs from 1, gives a closed formula for f(k+1) = a f(k) + b.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\nf n = a ^ n * f 0 + b * (a ^ n - 1) / (a - 1)\n\nthe closed form of an affine recurrence whose multiplier differs from one.\n参数 k\ninput k\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n域结构\nfield structure\nfield k\n参数 f\ninput f\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nℕ → k\n参数 a b\ninput a b\n具有所示类型的数学对象\nmathematical object of the displayed type\nk\n参数 n\ninput n\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ\n假设 ha\nassumption ha\n两者不相等\nthe two expressions differ\na ≠ 1\n假设 h\nassumption h\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ k < n, f (k + 1) = a * f k + b"
        },
        "TheoremOS.Algebra.FiniteSums.affine_recurrence_upper_bound": {
          "summary": {
            "zh": "递推系数非负时，将逐步递推上界展开为第 n 项的上界。",
            "en": "For a nonnegative recurrence coefficient, turns stepwise affine bounds into an upper bound on the nth term."
          },
          "text": "theoremos.algebra.finitesums.affine_recurrence_upper_bound\naffine_recurrence_upper_bound (f : ℕ → ℝ) (a b : ℝ) (n : ℕ) (ha : 0 ≤ a) (h : ∀ k < n, f (k + 1) ≤ a * f k + b) : f n ≤ a ^ n * f 0 + b * (∑ k ∈ range n, a ^ k)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.algebra.finitesums.\n递推系数非负时，将逐步递推上界展开为第 n 项的上界。\nfor a nonnegative recurrence coefficient, turns stepwise affine bounds into an upper bound on the nth term.\n在给定条件下，得到以下非严格界。\nunder the stated conditions, the following non-strict bound holds.\nf n ≤ a ^ n * f 0 + b * (∑ k ∈ range n, a ^ k)\n\na discrete affine upper bound, requiring only the recurrence inequality and nonnegative multiplier.\n参数 f\ninput f\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nℕ → ℝ\n参数 a b\ninput a b\n实数\nreal number\nℝ\n参数 n\ninput n\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ\n假设 ha\nassumption ha\n满足所示非严格界\nsatisfies the displayed non-strict bound\n0 ≤ a\n假设 h\nassumption h\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ k < n, f (k + 1) ≤ a * f k + b"
        }
