          "text": "theoremos.analysis.finiteconvexity.subprobability_reverse_jensen\nsubprobability_reverse_jensen (s : finset ι) (w x : ι → ℝ) (f : ℝ → ℝ) (c : set ℝ) (hf : concaveon ℝ c f) (hzero : (0 : ℝ) ∈ c) (hw : ∀ i ∈ s, 0 ≤ w i) (hw : (∑ i ∈ s, w i) ≤ 1) (hx : ∀ i ∈ s, x i ∈ c) : (∑ i ∈ s, w i * f (x i)) + (1 - ∑ i ∈ s, w i) * f 0 ≤ f (∑ i ∈ s, w i * x i)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.analysis.finiteconvexity.\nconcavity reverses the missing-mass jensen estimate.\nconcavity reverses the missing-mass jensen estimate.\n在给定条件下，得到以下非严格界。\nunder the stated conditions, the following non-strict bound holds.\n(∑ i ∈ s, w i * f (x i)) + (1 - ∑ i ∈ s, w i) * f 0 ≤ f (∑ i ∈ s, w i * x i)\n\nconcavity reverses the missing-mass jensen estimate.\n参数 s\ninput s\n有限集合\nfinite set\nfinset ι\n参数 w x\ninput w x\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → ℝ\n参数 f\ninput f\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nℝ → ℝ\n参数 c\ninput c\n集合\nset\nset ℝ\n假设 hf\nassumption hf\n函数在所示集合上凹\nthe function is concave on the displayed set\nconcaveon ℝ c f\n假设 hzero\nassumption hzero\n属于所示集合\nbelongs to the displayed set\n(0 : ℝ) ∈ c\n假设 hw\nassumption hw\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ i ∈ s, 0 ≤ w i\n假设 hw\nassumption hw\n满足所示非严格界\nsatisfies the displayed non-strict bound\n(∑ i ∈ s, w i) ≤ 1\n假设 hx\nassumption hx\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ i ∈ s, x i ∈ c\n参数 ι κ e f\ninput ι κ e f\n类型\ntype\ntype*"
