        "TheoremOS.Analysis.finToLpOne": {
          "summary": {
            "zh": "The finite vector `v`, padded with zeros, as an element of `ℓ¹`.",
            "en": "The finite vector `v`, padded with zeros, as an element of `ℓ¹`."
          },
          "text": "theoremos.analysis.fintolpone\nfintolpone {m : ℕ} (v : fin m → ℝ) : lp (fun _ : ℕ => ℝ) 1\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.analysis.metricdistortion.\nthe finite vector `v`, padded with zeros, as an element of `ℓ¹`.\nthe finite vector `v`, padded with zeros, as an element of `ℓ¹`.\n定义一个具有所示类型的数学对象。\ndefines a mathematical object of the displayed type.\n⟨fun i => if h : i < m then v ⟨i, h⟩ else 0, by\n    refine memℓp.of_exponent_ge (memℓp_zero ((set.finite_lt_nat m).subset ?_)) bot_le\n    intro i hi\n    by_contra h\n    have h' : ¬ i < m := h\n    exact hi (by simp [h'])⟩\nthe finite vector `v`, padded with zeros, as an element of `ℓ¹`.\nthe finite vector `v`, padded with zeros, as an element of `ℓ¹`.\n参数 m\ninput m\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ\n参数 v\ninput v\n有限下标\nfinite index\nfin m → ℝ\n参数 x\ninput x\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n参数 y\ninput y\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n所示类型类条件\nthe displayed typeclass condition\npseudometricspace y\n参数 ρ\ninput ρ\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nx → x → ℝ\n参数 f\ninput f\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nx → y"
        },
