          "text": "theoremos.geometry.monocopies\nmonocopies {ι p : type*} [dist p] (a : ι → p) (d r : ℕ) : prop\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.geometry.euclideanramsey.\nevery `r`-colouring of `ℝ^d` has a monochromatic congruent copy of `a`.\nevery `r`-colouring of `ℝ^d` has a monochromatic congruent copy of `a`.\n定义一个依赖所列指标的函数。\ndefines a dependent function over the indicated indices.\n∀ c : euclideanspace ℝ (fin d) → fin r, ∃ b : ι → euclideanspace ℝ (fin d),\n    congruentcopy a b ∧ ∃ k : fin r, ∀ i, c (b i) = k\nevery `r`-colouring of `ℝ^d` has a monochromatic congruent copy of `a`.\nevery `r`-colouring of `ℝ^d` has a monochromatic congruent copy of `a`.\n参数 ι p\ninput ι p\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n所示类型类条件\nthe displayed typeclass condition\ndist p\n参数 a\ninput a\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → p\n参数 d r\ninput d r\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ"
