          "text": "theoremos.geometry.iseuclideanramsey.join\niseuclideanramsey.join [finite ι] {d d' : ℕ} {a : ι → euclideanspace ℝ (fin d)} {a' : κ → euclideanspace ℝ (fin d')} (ha : iseuclideanramsey a) (ha' : iseuclideanramsey a') : iseuclideanramsey fun x : ι × κ => euclideanjoin (a x.1) (a' x.2)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.geometry.euclideanramsey.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\niseuclideanramsey fun x : ι × κ => euclideanjoin (a x.1) (a' x.2)\n\n\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型\nfinite type\nfinite ι\n参数 d d'\ninput d d'\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ\n参数 a\ninput a\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → euclideanspace ℝ (fin d)\n参数 a'\ninput a'\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nκ → euclideanspace ℝ (fin d')\n假设 ha\nassumption ha\n要求此命题成立\nthis proposition is assumed\niseuclideanramsey a\n假设 ha'\nassumption ha'\n要求此命题成立\nthis proposition is assumed\niseuclideanramsey a'\n参数 ι κ p q r\ninput ι κ p q r\n类型\ntype\ntype*"
