          "text": "theoremos.informationtheory.sum_mul_log_div_le_of_finset\nsum_mul_log_div_le_of_finset (s : finset ω) {a b : ω → ℝ} (ha : ∀ i, 0 ≤ a i) (hb : ∀ i, 0 ≤ b i) (hab : ∀ i, b i = 0 → a i = 0) : (∑ i ∈ s, a i) * log ((∑ i ∈ s, a i) / ∑ i ∈ s, b i) ≤ ∑ i ∈ s, a i * log (a i / b i)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.informationtheory.divergence.\nthe log-sum inequality on a sub-`finset`.\nthe log-sum inequality on a sub-`finset`.\n在给定条件下，得到以下非严格界。\nunder the stated conditions, the following non-strict bound holds.\n(∑ i ∈ s, a i) * log ((∑ i ∈ s, a i) / ∑ i ∈ s, b i) ≤ ∑ i ∈ s, a i * log (a i / b i)\n\nthe log-sum inequality on a sub-`finset`.\n参数 s\ninput s\n有限集合\nfinite set\nfinset ω\n参数 a b\ninput a b\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω → ℝ\n假设 ha\nassumption ha\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ i, 0 ≤ a i\n假设 hb\nassumption hb\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ i, 0 ≤ b i\n假设 hab\nassumption hab\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ i, b i = 0 → a i = 0\n参数 ω ω'\ninput ω ω'\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω'"
