          "text": "theoremos.informationtheory.relentropy_prod\nrelentropy_prod {p q : ω → ℝ} {p' q' : ω' → ℝ} (hp : isdistribution p) (hp' : isdistribution p') (hpq : ∀ ω, q ω = 0 → p ω = 0) (hpq' : ∀ ω, q' ω = 0 → p' ω = 0) : relentropy (fun x : ω × ω' => p x.1 * p' x.2) (fun x => q x.1 * q' x.2) = relentropy p q + relentropy p' q'\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.informationtheory.divergence.\nrelative entropy adds on products.\nrelative entropy adds on products.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\nrelentropy (fun x : ω × ω' => p x.1 * p' x.2) (fun x => q x.1 * q' x.2) = relentropy p q + relentropy p' q'\n\nrelative entropy adds on products.\n参数 p q\ninput p q\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω → ℝ\n参数 p' q'\ninput p' q'\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω' → ℝ\n假设 hp\nassumption hp\n要求此命题成立\nthis proposition is assumed\nisdistribution p\n假设 hp'\nassumption hp'\n要求此命题成立\nthis proposition is assumed\nisdistribution p'\n假设 hpq\nassumption hpq\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ ω, q ω = 0 → p ω = 0\n假设 hpq'\nassumption hpq'\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ ω, q' ω = 0 → p' ω = 0\n参数 ω ω'\ninput ω ω'\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω'"
