          "text": "theoremos.informationtheory.mutualinfo\nmutualinfo (r : ω × ω' → ℝ) : ℝ\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.informationtheory.divergence.\n互信息是联合权重相对于两个边际之积的相对熵。\nmutual information is the relative entropy of the joint weights from the product of their marginals.\n定义一个具有所示类型的数学对象。\ndefines a mathematical object of the displayed type.\nrelentropy r fun x => marginalleft r x.1 * marginalright r x.2\nmutual information of a joint law: `relentropy` against the product of its marginals.\nmutual information of a joint law: `relentropy` against the product of its marginals.\n参数 r\ninput r\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω × ω' → ℝ\n参数 ω ω'\ninput ω ω'\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω'"
