          "text": "theoremos.informationtheory.relentropy_uniform\nrelentropy_uniform [nonempty ω] {p : ω → ℝ} (hp : isdistribution p) : relentropy p (uniform ω) = log (fintype.card ω) - entropy p\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.informationtheory.divergence.\n`d(p‖uniform) = log |ω| - h(p)`.\n`d(p‖uniform) = log |ω| - h(p)`.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\nrelentropy p (uniform ω) = log (fintype.card ω) - entropy p\n\n`d(p‖uniform) = log |ω| - h(p)`.\n结构条件\nstructure\n类型非空\nnonempty type\nnonempty ω\n参数 p\ninput p\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω → ℝ\n假设 hp\nassumption hp\n要求此命题成立\nthis proposition is assumed\nisdistribution p\n参数 ω ω'\ninput ω ω'\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω'"
