          "text": "theoremos.probability.islopsideddependency\nislopsideddependency (p : ω → ℝ) (n : ι → finset ι) : prop\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.probability.locallemma.\n**lopsided dependency**: avoiding events outside the neighbourhood `n i` does not make\n`a i` more likely.\n**lopsided dependency**: avoiding events outside the neighbourhood `n i` does not make\n`a i` more likely.\n定义一个依赖所列指标的函数。\ndefines a dependent function over the indicated indices.\n∀ i (t : finset ι), disjoint t (n i) → i ∉ t →\n    prob p (a i ∩ avoid a t) ≤ prob p (a i) * prob p (avoid a t)\n**lopsided dependency**: avoiding events outside the neighbourhood `n i` does not make\n`a i` more likely.\n**lopsided dependency**: avoiding events outside the neighbourhood `n i` does not make\n`a i` more likely.\n参数 p\ninput p\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω → ℝ\n参数 n\ninput n\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → finset ι\n参数 ι ω\ninput ι ω\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n可判定的相等关系\ndecidable equality\ndecidableeq ω\n参数 a\ninput a\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → finset ω"
