          "text": "theoremos.probability.prob_avoid_insert\nprob_avoid_insert (p : ω → ℝ) (a : ι) (t : finset ι) : prob p (avoid a (insert a t)) = prob p (avoid a t) - prob p (a a ∩ avoid a t)\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.probability.locallemma.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\nprob p (avoid a (insert a t)) = prob p (avoid a t) - prob p (a a ∩ avoid a t)\n\n\n参数 p\ninput p\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nω → ℝ\n参数 a\ninput a\n具有所示类型的数学对象\nmathematical object of the displayed type\nι\n参数 t\ninput t\n有限集合\nfinite set\nfinset ι\n参数 ι ω\ninput ι ω\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n可判定的相等关系\ndecidable equality\ndecidableeq ω\n参数 a\ninput a\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → finset ω\n结构条件\nstructure\n可判定的相等关系\ndecidable equality\ndecidableeq ι"
