          "text": "theoremos.probability.signclauseequiv\nsignclauseequiv : signclause n k ≃ kclause n k where tofun c\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.probability.randomksat.\nsign vectors and (variable set, literal values) pairs are the same `k`-clauses.\nsign vectors and (variable set, literal values) pairs are the same `k`-clauses.\n定义一个具有所示类型的数学对象。\ndefines a mathematical object of the displayed type.\nwhere\n  tofun c := ⟨⟨finset.univ.filter fun i => (c.1 i).issome, c.2⟩, fun v => (c.1 v).getd false⟩\n  invfun c := ⟨fun i => if h : i ∈ c.1.1 then some (c.2 ⟨i, h⟩) else none, by\n    refine eq.trans ?_ c.1.2\n    congr 1\n    ext i\n    by_cases h : i ∈ c.1.1 <;> simp [h]⟩\n  left_inv c := by\n    refine subtype.ext (funext fun i => ?_)\n    cases h : c.1 i <;> simp [h]\n  right_inv c := by\n    refine kclause.ext ?_ fun v hc hd => ?_\n    · ext i\n      by_cases h : i ∈ c.1.1 <;> simp [h]\n    · simp only [finset.mem_filter, finset.mem_univ, true_and] at hc\n      simp [hd]\nsign vectors and (variable set, literal values) pairs are the same `k`-clauses.\nsign vectors and (variable set, literal values) pairs are the same `k`-clauses.\n参数 n k\ninput n k\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ"
