          "text": "theoremos.probability.eq_pow_of_recursion\neq_pow_of_recursion [decidableeq ω] (p : matrix ω ω ℝ) (k : ℕ → ω → ω → ℝ) (h0 : ∀ x, k 0 x x = 1) (h0' : ∀ x y, x ≠ y → k 0 x y = 0) (hs : ∀ t x y, k (t + 1) x y = ∑ z, k t x z * p z y) (t : ℕ) (x y : ω) : k t x y = (p ^ t) x y\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.probability.spectralgap.\na kernel power defined by recursion is the matrix power.\na kernel power defined by recursion is the matrix power.\n在给定条件下，所示两个表达式相等。\nunder the stated conditions, the two displayed expressions are equal.\nk t x y = (p ^ t) x y\n\na kernel power defined by recursion is the matrix power.\n结构条件\nstructure\n可判定的相等关系\ndecidable equality\ndecidableeq ω\n参数 p\ninput p\n矩阵\nmatrix\nmatrix ω ω ℝ\n参数 k\ninput k\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nℕ → ω → ω → ℝ\n假设 h0\nassumption h0\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ x, k 0 x x = 1\n假设 h0'\nassumption h0'\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ x y, x ≠ y → k 0 x y = 0\n假设 hs\nassumption hs\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ t x y, k (t + 1) x y = ∑ z, k t x z * p z y\n参数 t\ninput t\n自然数\nnatural number\nℕ\n参数 x y\ninput x y\n具有所示类型的数学对象\nmathematical object of the displayed type\nω\n参数 ω\ninput ω\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ω"
