          "text": "theoremos.representationtheory.fouriermap\nfouriermap (τ : ∀ i, representation ℂ g (u i)) : euclideanspace ℂ g →ₗ[ℂ] ∀ i, module.end ℂ (u i) where tofun f i\nfrozen library declaration from submission.library.theoremos.representationtheory.plancherel.\n`f ↦ (τ̂ᵢ(f))ᵢ` as a linear map on `ℓ²(g)`.\n`f ↦ (τ̂ᵢ(f))ᵢ` as a linear map on `ℓ²(g)`.\n定义一个具有所示类型的数学对象。\ndefines a mathematical object of the displayed type.\nwhere\n  tofun f i := groupfourier (τ i) f\n  map_add' f f' := by funext i; exact groupfourier_add (τ i) f f'\n  map_smul' c f := by funext i; exact groupfourier_smul (τ i) c f\n`f ↦ (τ̂ᵢ(f))ᵢ` as a linear map on `ℓ²(g)`.\n`f ↦ (τ̂ᵢ(f))ᵢ` as a linear map on `ℓ²(g)`.\n假设 τ\nassumption τ\n对所列全部指标均成立\nholds for every indicated index\n∀ i, representation ℂ g (u i)\n参数 g\ninput g\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n群结构\ngroup structure\ngroup g\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype g\n参数 ι\ninput ι\n类型\ntype\ntype*\n结构条件\nstructure\n有限类型及其枚举\nfinite type with an enumeration\nfintype ι\n参数 u\ninput u\n具有所示定义域和值域的函数\nfunction with the displayed domain and codomain\nι → type*\n结构条件\nstructure\n所示类型类条件\nthe displayed typeclass condition\n∀ i, addcommgroup (u i)\n结构条件\nstructure\n所示类型类条件\nthe displayed typeclass condition\n∀ i, module ℂ (u i)"
